Two preconditions trip the harness unless they're explicitly handled:
(1) The module has no exports. We monkey-patch `http.createServer` BEFORE requiring the     module to capture the handler and return a stub whose `listen()` is a no-op (binding     port 8000 fails under --network none anyway).
